### Corpus-Aware Sizing Logic (size="auto")

```python
def calculate_size(num_docs: int, num_chunks: int, tier: str) -> int:
    """
    Based on Section 7 of the source document.

    Corpus Size     | minimal   | medium    | exhaustive
    ----------------+-----------+-----------+------------
    <50 docs        | 40        | 80-100    | 200
    50-200 docs     | 50-60     | 100-150   | 200-280
    200-500 docs    | 60-70     | 150-200   | 280-400
    500-1000 docs   | 70-80     | 200-280   | 350-500
    1000-5000 docs  | 80        | 280-370   | 500-600
    5000+ docs      | 80        | 370       | 600

    Also tracks document_coverage_target:
    - minimal:    no target (best effort)
    - medium:     15-30% document coverage
    - exhaustive: 20-40% document coverage
    """
```

