## Staleness Detection

Available via `eval_set.check_staleness(docs_dir="./docs")`.

Maps each eval record to its source document IDs. Compares document file hashes/modification times against when the eval set was generated.

```python
@dataclass
class StalenessReport:
    stale_records: list[StaleRecord]          # records whose source docs changed
    total_records: int
    stale_count: int
    stale_ratio: float
    recommendations: list[str]                # "Re-validate 15 records referencing updated docs"

@dataclass
class StaleRecord:
    record_id: str
    source_doc_ids: list[str]
    change_type: str                          # "modified" | "deleted" | "moved"
```

